  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Centre for Health Economics i York och University of York f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av den tredje internationella h&#xe4;lsoeknomkonferensen i York 2001 inklusive NHA seminarium. St&#xf6;det omfattar sponsring av tio deltagare fr&#xe5;n utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder samt administrativt st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av konferensen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Centre for health economics and University of York for organising the third internatinoal conference in Health Economics including NHA symposium in York 2001. The support includes ten delegates from developing countries and support to the administration of the conference.</narrative>
